WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:08.970
Recognizing images in other apps with Seeing
AI.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:13.800
So far, we have seen the different channels
which allow you to get different types of

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.850
information about the world around you.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:23.030
However, sometimes you want to get that kind
of information about photos that already exist,

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:28.199
maybe in your camera roll, but also within
another apps, like Twitter or WhatsApp or

00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:30.050
Mail.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:37.320
With Seeing AI, you can actually use the same
technology to recognize those photos too.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:42.960
Whenever you come across an image where you
need a description off, you use the app’s

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.320
share feature.

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:49.060
Not because you want to share it, but because
at the bottom of that share pane, there are

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:52.230
different actions like copy and print.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:56.460
And there is also an action called “Recognize
with Seeing AI”.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:01.949
So, when you select that, you will get the
same descriptions that you’ve seen with

00:01:01.949 --> 00:01:05.920
other channels on that photo that came from
Twitter or WhatsApp.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:11.180
Now, that’s really cool because sometimes
you’ll get an invitation in an email which

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.900
is just an image instead of the actual text.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:19.340
Or maybe you’re on twitter and there is
a funny photo that everybody is commenting

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:20.340
on.

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:24.180
So now, with this feature, you can participate
in those too.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:29.890
So here, I have the twitter app with a tweet
from my colleague Meher open.

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:32.330
Let’s see what it says.

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:34.570
&gt; So many chores to do today.

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:39.360
&gt; Landscape, image
&gt; Double tap to view full size image

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:42.000
So clearly that’s a comment about this image.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.680
But wouldn’t it be great if I could know
what’s inside this image.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.610
That’s what we can do with Seeing AI.

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:51.470
So let’s open up the image.

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:55.450
&gt; Landscape, image
&gt; Double tap and hold for more actions

00:01:55.450 --> 00:02:02.860
Add let’s bring up those actions
&gt; Enable airdrop sharing.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:06.840
Button
And across the bottom here, we have different

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.700
actions to perform on the image.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:12.421
&gt; Cancel
&gt; Delete photo, Save photo, button

00:02:12.421 --> 00:02:16.610
&gt; Open in Safari, button
&gt; Recognize with Seeing AI, button

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:22.849
That’s the one we want
&gt; Processing

00:02:22.849 --> 00:02:26.099
&gt; Text
&gt; Gotta drop off my laundry and pick up my

00:02:26.099 --> 00:02:29.799
bone
&gt; Scene: A dog sitting on the seat of a car

00:02:29.799 --> 00:02:33.280
Hah, funny
Microsoft logo appears

